flowchart TB
    subgraph IN[输入与身份]
      direction LR
      A[输入<br/>dict｜YAML｜JSON｜文件｜kwargs] --> B[解析、优先级合并与旧字段迁移]
      B --> C[从登录身份 / 服务 Token<br/>强制注入 creator]
      C --> D{SDK 权限守卫}
      D -->|拒绝| X[结构化错误<br/>message / errors / trace_id]
    end
    subgraph CHECK[建模、校验与幂等]
      direction LR
      E[构建 MetadataEntity、URN 与 MCP] --> F[业务字段 + Domain 校验]
      F --> G[按 URN 获取并发注册锁] --> H{实体已存在?}
    end
    subgraph DEP[依赖与发布]
      direction LR
      I[skip / overwrite 判定] --> J[Task 上游 Dataset / Pipeline<br/>依赖检查] --> K{发布通道}
    end
    subgraph OUT[确认与返回]
      direction LR
      L[REST Emitter] --> N[轮询确认实体可查询]
      M[Kafka Emitter] --> N
      N --> O[返回 success / message / trace_id]
    end
    D -->|通过| E
    H -->|是| I
    H -->|否| J
    K -->|REST| L
    K -->|Kafka| M
    classDef input fill:#EAF2F8,stroke:#2F5D7C,stroke-width:1.8px,color:#18324B;
    classDef guard fill:#FFF4E5,stroke:#B7791F,stroke-width:2px,color:#5F3B0A;
